{"version":1,"ops":[{"type":1,"author":{"id":"b3cab00338425c0da6d741f037644050ffaa3e47"},"timestamp":1540324766,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzNzMxNzUxNzY=","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/2942","origin":"github"},"title":"Two unwanted changes within .datalad/config and datalad/.gitattributes when rerunning datalad create --force","message":"#### What is the problem?\nSubsequent changes to an existing datalad dataset via datalad create --force \n\n1. change the dataset id\n2. unnecessarily add the line ` 'metadata/aggregate* annex.largefile=nothing ` in .gitattributes again\n\n#### What steps will reproduce the problem?\n\n`datalad create foo`\n`datalad create --force --text-no-annex foo`\n\n`tig` shows:  \n\n`diff --git a/.datalad/config b/.datalad/config`\n`index a8b1392..a530b30 100644`\n`--- a/.datalad/config`\n`+++ b/.datalad/config`\n`@@ -1,2 +1,2 @@`\n` [datalad \"dataset\"]`\n`-       id = 65f3c046-d6fc-11e8-9873-40a3cc1bd9a6`\n`+       id = 6f267582-d6fc-11e8-bc04-40a3cc1bd9a6`\n`diff --git a/.gitattributes b/.gitattributes`\n`index c3aaefe..57c0a11 100644`\n`--- a/.gitattributes`\n`+++ b/.gitattributes`\n`@@ -1,3 +1,5 @@`\n\n` * annex.backend=MD5E`\n`+**/.git* annex.largefiles=nothing`\n`+* annex.largefiles=(not(mimetype=text/*))`\n` **/.git* annex.largefiles=nothing`\n`\\ No newline at end of file`\n\n#### What version of DataLad are you using (run `datalad --version`)? On what operating system (consider running `datalad wtf`)?\n\ndatalad 0.10.3.1.dev166\n\n#### Is there anything else that would be useful to know in this context?\n\n@yarikoptic please add anything that I stated unclear or wrong","files":null}]}